The draft commit `origin/claude/mobile-no-highlight` (8c423ffa8b) is right. Read it with `git show origin/claude/mobile-no-highlight:<path>`, but do not check it out or switch branches. This plan reuses its CSS and moves its test into a new file. It adds one thing the draft misses (step 4).

