- `it("#3260 the two-step key stays copyable under a finger: it has no copy button")`: `bodyOf(rulesIn(code("auth/two-step.css")), ".tavern.app-shell .account-two-step__secret")` matches `-webkit-user-select: all;` and `UNPREFIXED_SELECT("all")`.

